signedHead = actual signed sum truncated at M (the head of Erdos-Turan).
sgnBnd = |head| + tail. sharpen = absBound/sgnBnd (how much tighter the signed bound is).
If sgnBnd tracks |Delta_w| (much < absBound), the signed estimate shrinks the finite base.

DONE.
